Z||000006||Monkeyman||04-03-2000||06:43 PM||||Does look good.  I was the one who had the alternate p/m switch idea.  The p/m switch out of some mid-'80s to early '90s FoMoCo vehicles should work.  The switch is a joystick style that fits almost perfectly in the same bezel as our manual mirror joystick.  This way you can use your existing door panel without having to figure out a way to cover up the hole.  In the meantime, I got the Grape Ape which already has p/m so I never got around to figuring out how to wire it up.||||reg||1
Z||000007||007DOUG||04-04-2000||01:38 AM||||That is an awesome touch.<P>I'm the only person that drives my fieros, so when I get the mirrors set, they're pretty much etched in stone. I never have to touch the switch.||||reg||10
